}, "change_log": "1.15 Sucker Punch VR Update!\n\n- Wield the new Robo Fist!\n- Overwhelm your enemies with the new Slicer Wall power!\n- Play new rule sets.\n- Experience the updated Nutz Wood level in the Arcade.\n- Expert drone balancing\n...and some minor bug fixes and balancing.\n", "created_date": 1648756169, "id": "4949408571762210", "version": "1.15", "version_code": 27, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4283216598381414", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "4965904050112662"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "446677046580443"}]}, "change_log": "Welcome to the Arcade!\n\nA NEW game mode in Sucker Punch VR!\n\nProgress through the levels, battling progressively more difficult drones! Defeat each boss drone and push your high score up the leaderboard! Holding the highest score will take cunning strategy and lightning reflexes.\n\nWelcome to your next challenge!", "created_date": 1647556841, "id": "4912483892121345", "version": "1.14", "version_code": 26, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4283216598381414", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "4965904050112662"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1647549946, "id": "49